      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_54",
        on: "new_turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Whenever we stumble upon a corpse, it awakens its nearby allies! What will happen when we wake their leaders?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("It may be prudent to clear the swamp near the undead leaders before we sight them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_53",
        on: "explain_ambushers",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Gah, undead! This one was mired face-first in the swamp, dormant until I stumbled upon it. They must be lying everywhere in this muck."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Perhaps their leaders are dormant as well. I suspect we will not have to contend with them until we sight them. We can afford some time to capture villages and build our forces."),
          },
        ],
      },
