          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("At last we have reached the Horse Plains, the fair homeland of my people! Here we can finally reunite with our comrades-in-arms and vanquish the undead once and for all."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Owaec",
            x: 47,
            y: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Hail, Clansmen! Come and greet one of your own!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Fallen_Clansman",
            type: "Walking Corpse",
            side: 7,
            x: 44,
            y: 26,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Fallen_Clansman",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "zombie-hit-1.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Fallen Clansman",
            x: 46,
            y: 26,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Fallen Clansman",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("No."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("No, NO! Why are there swamps here? Why are there undead here? How can this be?! How can Mal-Ravanal have already advanced so far into the heartland of Wesnoth?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("I’m sorry Owaec. The undead armies must have defeated the Clansmen and dammed the river to drown the plains. They must like the swamp, filled with death and decay..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("My home... my people... how could this happen..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Owaec",
            x: 49,
            y: 26,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("YOU! MAGE!!! Had you not insisted we travel north, we might have arrived in time to save these people! My friends, my family, dead from your neglect. And all for what? Some necromancer’s trinket more likely to curse us than save us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("We trusted you. I trusted you! Instead, you sent us away from the war like cowards, led our men to slaughter at the hand of orcs and drakes, and deprived Wesnoth of her eastern guard when she needed it most sorely. And now my homeland has paid the price for your misdeeds!!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Are you even listening?!?"),
