            text: _("Neither did I. I should have sensed it, but the darkness is nearly overwhelming. Even with my inner light, the best I can do is cancel out this dark energy. Such is the price of power..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("... but it is a necessary price to pay. I will not let up until Mal-Ravanal is defeated, whatever the cost may be."),
