            speaker: "Sir Efran",
            text: _("... Necromancer... Wesnoth will defeat you... in the end."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_175",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Khrakrahs%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Khrakrahs",
            text: _("I am... ...<i>cold</i>."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_176",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Dacyn, I’ve been thinking. This artifact has had such a draining effect on you. Perhaps you should rest and take a moment to regain your strength? I could carry the Amulet for a while, or we could store it away."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Hmm... I suppose there would be no harm in locking it up somewhere safe."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            portrait: "units/unknown-unit1.png",
            text: _("<span size='small' font-style='italic'>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            portrait: "units/unknown-unit2.png",
            text: _("<span size='small' font-style='italic'>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            portrait: "units/unknown-unit1.png",
            text: _("<span size='small' font-style='italic'>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("But on the other hand... this is a dangerous artifact. I fear that only I can withstand its energies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Well, you’re the magic expert."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_177",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("If the Horse Clans have fallen so completely, I fear for Weldyn and the rest of Wesnoth. We must make the most of our time here; we cannot afford to tarry too long."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_178",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("So much death. So many of my kinsmen left unavenged. If only we had more time..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("We have done all we could here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_179",
        on: "die",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sir%20Seoraery%2CSir%20Efran%2CKhrakrahs%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_180",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Mage... I owe you an apology. This destruction... even had we journeyed here instead of questing north, we would most assuredly have made no difference. Of that I am now certain. The fates may yet reveal that our journey north was necessary, even at such a steep cost. I will stand by you in this fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Apology accepted."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("And I too must admit, I underestimated the power in this Amulet. Even now, voices gnaw at the edges of my mind..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Make no mistake, I still do not approve of your plan! It will lead you only to ruin and death! Yet, at least now I believe that your intentions are good despite your questionable methods."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("I’m glad we have prevailed here, but I fear greatly for Wesnoth if the Clans have been defeated so thoroughly so quickly. It has scant been a year since their invasion first began. Owaec, Dacyn, if you are prepared to travel, we must press toward Weldyn at once."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_181",
        on: "defeat",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Their home country had proved to be no refuge for Gweddry’s weary men, and no more would it for the inhabitants of Wesnoth as foes pressed them on all sides to a final defense of the doomed kingdom."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_182",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Gweddry%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("No! I... die..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_183",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Dacyn%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("The light fades... We are doomed..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_184",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Owaec%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("I... must— Argh...!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_185",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Addogin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Addogin",
            text: _("How did I get dragged into this mess..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_186",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Hahid%20al-Ali%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hahid al-Ali",
            text: _("Alas, my long, storied, and exceedingly profitable career has at last come to an end, so far from home! I only... wish I could have died on the soft sands... instead of among these primitive barbarians..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Bar... ber... bears? Die why?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Aye, ‘tis a sad place for one o’ us foreigners to fall. We’ll miss ye, that’s for sure."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_187",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Terraent%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Terraent",
            text: _("And so, I give... the last thing I have to give... in service of the Light..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("You shall be gravely missed, paladin of the Light! May you long live on in song and tale."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_188",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Grug%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grug",
            text: _("Hurt... grarrgghh..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Though he was not one of us, he served bravely alongside Wesnoth’s best. We must carry on the good fight."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_189",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Dolburras%22%2C%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolburras",
            text: _("Watch out behind ye— ach!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Though he was not one of us, he served bravely alongside Wesnoth’s best. We must carry on the good fight."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_190",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Gaennell%22%2C%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gaennell",
            text: _("Death is coming for me..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Terraent",
            text: _("Truly, you have proven that there is goodness within all of us. I pledge that your sacrifice will not be in vain!"),
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
